<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF to seek 80,000T oilseeds on Friday.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF to seek 80,000T oilseeds on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) will invite tenders to buy 50,000 tonnes of tapioca hard pellet at 11.00 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Friday, an official with the federation said on Monday.</p>
<p>The official said the federation will also invite tenders to buy 30,000 tonnes of wheat bran pellet or rice bran pellet on the same day.  </p>
<p>The official said if it passes on the tenders in whole or partially on Friday due to high prices, it will re-invite the tenders on May 6.</p>
<p>The details for the tenders are as follows:</p>
<p> COMMODITY    TONNE    ETA     ARRIVAL PORT</p>
<p> Tapioca     10,000    Jun 20  Inchon/Kunsan</p>
<p> Tapioca     10,000    Jul 10  Inchon/Kunsan</p>
<p> Tapioca     10,000    Jul 30  Inchon/Kunsan</p>
<p> Tapioca     10,000    Aug 20  Inchon/Kunsan</p>
<p> Tapioca     10,000    Sep 10  Inchon/Kunsan</p>
<p> Wheat bran  15,000    Jul 10  Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p> Wheat bran  15,000    Sep 10  Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p> Rice bran   15,000    Jul 10  Kunsan</p>
<p> Rice bran   15,000    Sep 10  Kunsan</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
